---
description: Keep project changes scoped, direct and free of unnecessary abstractions
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Overcoding

- Choose the smallest direct change that moves the checkpoint.
- Do not add dependencies or abstractions unless they remove real repeated pain.
- Do not create project-specific skills for one-off tasks.
- Do not rewrite unrelated areas to make a checkpoint pass.
- Keep rules concise; heavy workflows belong in playbooks or skills.
